{"id":"01700421-8df1-4173-adc9-5097f56b5ccc","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"e64d28d2a89d6d7c","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"a422ae592bea425d058246556abd192fa59c6b04","start":3863,"end":3903},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["let","connection",":","WorkspaceConnection","=","{","}"]},"context":{"before":"11b15181b08d212f","after":"874d71284387a404"}},"payload":{"text":"What this realm does with its workspace mount beyond using it (see connectWorkspace).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:40.355Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:40.355Z"}
{"id":"02a15819-09b3-47ae-9039-46c26e12788f","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"11b15181b08d212f","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"1aa6cecaf989b80d25dbe16b277ceed429e4bcf9","start":3577,"end":3633},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["let","sharedWorkspaceBuffer",":","SharedArrayBuffer","|","undefined"]},"context":{"before":"ad875c3b9333aec1","after":"e64d28d2a89d6d7c"}},"payload":{"text":"The workspace SAB, retained once received so a worker can HAND IT ON to a freshly-spawned child worker (the\npreview.provoke hardReset path spawns a cold child per round; it mounts this same buffer). undefined without COI.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:41.398Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:41.398Z"}
{"id":"0ee7e9aa-4cb4-4dba-8caa-3fd20297cc40","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"5517c150166f76e1","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"9b5c85acaa8b4d41e90d8e7ad1f6764dc7d9d046","start":2850,"end":2886},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","WORKSPACE_MOUNT","=","\"","/workspace","\""]},"context":{"before":"70479b5aee404394","after":"059a448c4cd7b457"}},"payload":{"text":"── Shared workspace mount (unification M3b) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nThe workbench owns a SharedArrayBuffer-backed zen-fs mounted at /workspace; the ext host forwards that buffer\nhere over a control MessagePort. We mount the SAME buffer at /workspace, ADDITIVELY — the InMemory root\n(tooling: the dict, the server bundle) is untouched; the worker just GAINS the real workspace files from the\none filesystem the editor + type-checker use. Non-breaking: if no buffer ever arrives (no COI / standalone),\nthe worker runs exactly as before.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:42.420Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:42.420Z"}
{"id":"25936f86-c549-4325-972f-9cd5330f6626","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"d87ee0aba19ece40","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"b95c0aaa89bbb29fba842f260de71435e9bd3cf3","start":4035,"end":4061},"shape":{"type":"PropertySignature","atoms":["\"","architecture","\"","?",":","ArchSink",";"]},"context":{"before":"9442b09c92f426d4#1","after":"8084fdf9c41a1eb3"}},"payload":{"text":"Put the mount and every store operation on the live architecture diagram.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:39.285Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:39.285Z"}
{"id":"631c31e1-3ca8-4f51-b8b5-3b0c5662ea3d","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"7ce97ae843b6d42e","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"4855ce016b7c518e6e7db4273b0c9dd926821338","start":7073,"end":7356},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","async","function","createZenfsVFS","(",")",":","Promise","<","VirtualFS",">","{","await","configure","(","{","\"","mounts","\"",":","{","\"","/","\"",":","InMemory","}","}",")",";","configured","=","true",";","const","buffer","=","pendingBuffer",";","if","(","buffer","!==","undefined",")","{","pendingBuffer","=","undefined",";","await","mountSharedWorkspace","(","buffer",")",";","}","return","adapter",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"d738cc5e143be4a5"}},"payload":{"text":"Configure zen-fs (InMemory root) and return a VirtualFS-shaped adapter over it, ready to hand to almostnode's\n`createRuntime`. If the shared workspace buffer already arrived, mount it now. Safe to call once per worker.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:31.843Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:31.843Z"}
{"id":"817f0b76-ecfb-4ca8-b9cf-638e54a121a5","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"3dbad996fb29c44d#3","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"197c755feaa923a4442691f4706b872329c1dabf","start":7688,"end":7702},"shape":{"type":"Return","atoms":["return","adapter"]},"context":{"before":"c9f9df195a58f476"}},"payload":{"text":"Duck-typed: almostnode only calls the public VirtualFS methods, which this delegates to zen-fs.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:29.707Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:29.707Z"}
{"id":"8b48a20e-8aac-44f2-84a0-f614ed50467f","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"8084fdf9c41a1eb3","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"535d48e8ef32dd7866a80f60acd2b60729f2319d","start":4145,"end":4196},"shape":{"type":"PropertySignature","atoms":["\"","onChanges","\"","?",":","(","changes",":","WorkspaceChange","[]",")","=>","void",";"]},"context":{"before":"d87ee0aba19ece40","after":"9819ce02048e6de8"}},"payload":{"text":"Report every change this realm makes to the workspace (see workspace-changes.ts) — the node worker publishes\nthem on its hub, so the workbench persists and announces them.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:38.225Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:38.225Z"}
{"id":"a74e67a4-d7fc-4adb-8bc2-13e618c06bf7","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"9819ce02048e6de8","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"3a9972f4edb20a153b3812b371b6a1df35c0394b","start":4385,"end":4616},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","function","connectWorkspace","(","options",":","WorkspaceConnection",")",":","void","{","connection","=","options",";","const","store","=","mounted","?","defaultContext",".","mounts",".","get","(","WORKSPACE_MOUNT",")",":","undefined",";","if","(","store","!==","undefined",")","{","connectStore","(","store",")",";","}","}"]},"context":{"before":"874d71284387a404","after":"90be74c40700b977"}},"payload":{"text":"Wire this realm's workspace mount into the editor (now, or when the buffer arrives).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:37.155Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:37.155Z"}
{"id":"c96cca81-af16-4dbd-b872-6d051bc3e475","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"4abb973857f68052","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"9c7f2c14b6ecd3e67f02d0c02de093c69829ddcc","start":7502,"end":7527},"shape":{"type":"AssignmentExpression","atoms":["pendingBuffer","=","undefined"]},"context":{"before":"e21a7adeebf1070a","after":"6c4f347ef7be060f#1"}},"payload":{"text":"Taken before the mount: once configured, attachSharedWorkspace mounts a buffer itself and never sets it again.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:30.785Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:30.785Z"}
{"id":"d2981691-2a76-4e9c-a0e8-92f956d26727","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"1115637d21f9af1b","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"2e77757ae53c35c5e6e77f57452540383867838b","start":6493,"end":6536},"shape":{"type":"CallExpression","atoms":["store",".","attributes",".","set","(","\"","no_atime","\"",",","undefined",")"]},"context":{"before":"7b1f77fd42170ea4","after":"546273ad0281a4c4#1"}},"payload":{"text":"No atime, as the workbench mounts it (workspace-fs.ts): a read here mustn't change a file's ctime, or git takes\nevery file this realm reads for a changed one.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:32.909Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:32.909Z"}
{"id":"ecbf67ef-482c-49da-817d-b06fe86d0018","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"f8f003b08d0feb27","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"ba03399b40156eac4b131b7cfd399f7ad8fb1fa1","start":5830,"end":6079},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","async","function","mountWorkspaceVfs","(","buffer",":","SharedArrayBuffer",")",":","Promise","<","VirtualFS",">","{","await","configure","(","{","\"","mounts","\"",":","{","\"","/","\"",":","InMemory","}","}",")",";","configured","=","true",";","sharedWorkspaceBuffer","=","buffer",";","await","mountSharedWorkspace","(","buffer",")",";","return","adapter",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"9c4dd038cd880063","after":"d738cc5e143be4a5"}},"payload":{"text":"Mount the workspace SAB into THIS realm's zen-fs and return a VirtualFS adapter over it. For a fresh child\nworker that received the buffer directly — e.g. the provoke child worker.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:33.969Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:33.969Z"}
{"id":"ecc06517-12b2-4bcb-801e-43a72aab9e5b","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"268b30011334fb7f","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"c7c4bbfb91f3909fa1a7651a45dc0f2ced82a146","start":0,"end":59},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","VirtualFS","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/almostnode","\""]},"context":{"after":"d441c9c8b18bf2a1"}},"payload":{"text":"A `VirtualFS`-shaped adapter backed by zen-fs, so almostnode runs on zen-fs instead of its own in-memory\ntree. almostnode drives its VFS through public methods only (readFileSync/existsSync/statSync/readdirSync/\nwriteFileSync/watch/on/…), so we delegate those to zen-fs's `fs`. This is the seam that lets one filesystem\nback the runtime's module loads, the tool's I/O, and — later — the editor: swap the zen-fs BACKEND from\nInMemory to a SharedArrayBuffer store shared with the main thread, and bind a vscode FileSystemProvider to\nthe same zen-fs, without touching this adapter or the tools.\n\nToday it configures an InMemory backend. Events/watch/snapshot are no-ops: cspell is read-mostly, and the\nin-realm runtime never calls toSnapshot (that's WorkerRuntime's transfer path). Live coherence (wiring\nzen-fs change events into `on('change')`) comes with the shared backend.\n\nIt's a plain object, not a class: there's no per-instance state — every method delegates to zen-fs's single\nmodule-global `fs`.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:43.480Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:43.480Z"}
{"id":"ed1bd8ea-b9f6-4212-a071-78bbb5047521","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"9c4dd038cd880063","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"cd09334dfbd63488fb62f00ea7ceec3c8fc86bc1","start":5600,"end":5708},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","function","getSharedWorkspaceBuffer","(",")",":","SharedArrayBuffer","|","undefined","{","return","sharedWorkspaceBuffer",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"7c46b585f70121f9","after":"f8f003b08d0feb27"}},"payload":{"text":"The received workspace SharedArrayBuffer, or undefined if none arrived (no cross-origin isolation / standalone).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:35.045Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:35.045Z"}
{"id":"eeea90a0-2129-4f26-9819-ecc96bab5e62","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"7c46b585f70121f9","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"9681c5f46608c4a9ed469d74e666c8baf6c97296","start":4971,"end":5369},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","function","attachSharedWorkspace","(","buffer",":","unknown",")",":","void","{","if","(","typeof","SharedArrayBuffer","===","\"","undefined","\"","||","!","(","buffer","instanceof","SharedArrayBuffer",")",")","{","return",";","}","sharedWorkspaceBuffer","=","buffer",";","if","(","configured",")","{","void","mountSharedWorkspace","(","buffer",")",";","}","else","{","pendingBuffer","=","buffer",";","}","}"]},"context":{"before":"90be74c40700b977","after":"9c4dd038cd880063"}},"payload":{"text":"Hand this realm the workspace SharedArrayBuffer (from the hub, or its launch): mounted at /workspace once\nzen-fs is configured. A non-shared value (no cross-origin isolation) is ignored — the realm keeps its own root.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:36.106Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:56:36.106Z"}
{"id":"0eaacf47-558f-49ff-ad45-fae308335922","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"3a74ae5ad9e85eb3#0","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"8e3cd5dc3f57709434b1ee761917e4c2a19d79ec","start":2821,"end":2851},"shape":{"type":"AssignmentExpression","atoms":["sharedWorkspaceBuffer","=","buffer"]},"context":{"before":"e9d467e5b0e3b972","after":"421e9359021c815f"}},"payload":{"text":"retained so we can hand it to a spawned child worker","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T19:07:47.564Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T19:07:47.564Z"}
{"id":"65a695d1-0c92-43c6-a0b5-ccf4c4791a9b","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"74b256a3187e43e6","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shared/zenfs-vfs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"a1202a31b68e9c8c2022f41ec214c8d427cd1fa7","start":2978,"end":3000},"shape":{"type":"AssignmentExpression","atoms":["pendingBuffer","=","buffer"]},"context":{"before":"a4a3e548a9b978a6","after":"9c4dd038cd880063"}},"payload":{"text":"createZenfsVFS mounts it once configured","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T19:07:45.837Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T19:07:45.837Z"}
